 if len(files)==4:
  meta={'id':ASSET,'version':'1.0.0','category':'scenes','assetKind':'scene','theme':'culture','style':'source-preserved-low-poly','title':TITLE,'description':'One static whole-accessory dressing-alcove scene, zero new independent models and one new scene. The entire qualified pair of geta-inspired wooden footwear rests on a broad low landing with both full boards, all four complete teeth, all six through holes and both full thongs unchanged. The entire qualified plain nested case stands independently on a small fixed rear wall shelf above the footwear rear region, retaining all three complete compartments, full receiver lid, eight whole side channels, one full continuous cord and pierced slider. Every original raw GLB buffer, oriented triangle, POSITION and NORMAL array, full PBR dictionary, face assignment and internal hierarchy is retained unchanged at unit metre scale under whole translations only; complete generator sources are embedded solely as unexecuted provenance. One newly authored continuous alcove boundary joins the entire low floor, tall rear wall, short left return and raised rear shelf. All four original footwear soles and the complete original case sole have measured finite contact on their own levels. The vertical overlap in plan leaves an actual empty gap above the footwear and below the shelf; the front and right remain open. Unlike the freestanding bench/rack/cubby arrival grouping this is a compact wall-attached vertical footwear-and-small-case niche, and unlike the lucet/spindle parallel-bay tray the upper object is on a rear wall shelf well above an open lower landing rather than in adjacent long tool channels. No old component extracted, changed, recoloured, scaled or recounted. Original general cultural-category exhibit only, not a documented historical dressing arrangement, authentic combined outfit, museum replica, working storage specification or human-scale room. No wearer, clothing, netsuke toggle, labels, wardrobe door, dressing procedure, ergonomic access, hanging, handling, load capacity, physical stability, manufacture, installation or safety capability is supplied. Rigging, animation and interaction not made.','bounds':dict(zip(['x','y','z'],[hi[k]-lo[k]for k in range(3)]),unit='m'),'triangles':triangle_count,'materials':10,'files':files,'status':'review','license':'All rights reserved'}
